    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d91-a2">

                <pb facs="0255" n="121" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg121"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    769.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Delgado to Mr.
                            Hall</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-01-09"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 9,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have just received your esteemed
                    communication of the 6th instant, y Government returns to you its most sincere
                    thanks for your generous offer and accepts it with the greatest pleasure. I
                    earnestly request you to be pleased to inform me the day on which you leave for
                    this Republic.</p>
                <p>With consideration, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Manuel
                            Delgado.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
